# Supermarket Goods Management System 🛒

Inventory and sales management for supermarkets.

## Features
- Product entry & barcode search
- Stock tracking with low-stock alerts
- Expiry date monitoring
- Automatic stock deduction on sale
- Daily sales reports (1000+ products)

## Tech Stack
JavaScript, Node.js, MySQL, Express

